<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TechForce upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TechForce upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown analyst Edward Caso said he upgraded TechForce Corp to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Cited strong first quarter earnings. Raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $0.56 from $0.55 and has 1998 estimate at $0.73.</p>
<p>-- Said company's credit problem with Packard Bell is behind it. Its core business of supporting networks is &quot;booming.&quot; It has favorable year-over-year earnings comparisons ahead and the stock is cheap, he said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 6-1/4.</p>
</text>
